# --- Connecting words: `an`/`mee` do not invert, but a following adverb does ---

@sentence
@lu Ech gi moies akafen an ech ginn an de Fitness.
@en I go shopping in the morning and I go to the gym.
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-en stay
@distractor-lu owes
@distractor-lu bleiwen

@sentence
@lu Ech gi moies akafen an dono ginn ech an de Fitness.
@en I go shopping in the morning and afterwards I go to the gym.
@distractor-en before
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-lu virdrun
@distractor-lu owes

@sentence
@lu Ech ginn oft an de Kino, mee heiansdo kucken ech e Film doheem.
@en I often go to the cinema, but sometimes I watch a film at home.
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en city
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu Stad

